        "text": "=:warning: *{{ $(\"Site Watcher Agent\").item.json.output.project }}* is *{{ $(\"Site Watcher Agent\").item.json.output.status }}* ({{ $(\"Site Watcher Agent\").item.json.output.days_behind }} days behind){{ $(\"Site Watcher Agent\").item.json.output.site_update_received ? \"\" : \"\\n*No site update was logged today.*\" }}\n\n*What slipped:* {{ $(\"Site Watcher Agent\").item.json.output.risk_summary }}\n*Suggested actions:* {{ $(\"Site Watcher Agent\").item.json.output.recommended_actions }}\n\n*Draft buyer update (not sent):* {{ $(\"Site Watcher Agent\").item.json.output.buyer_update_draft }}\n\nAny new date or buyer message needs your approval. Delay interest is 10.70% a year on all money paid.",
